{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3ad15e4d3500502aa3087c8fa50cb3393f868db6dc421c5fedac13a71717c228", "ja": "（今日は杏奈が考えた『理想の結婚式』というテーマで\n撮影をする予定なのだが、緊急事態が発生した……）", "zh": "（今天原本计划以杏奈构想的“理想婚礼”为主题进行拍摄，可是发生了紧急情况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0b2e006d728e4bc497a1c29f43c5d3e5545f26c7b5680c77decf8a5989ba9d22", "ja": "ここにいたんだな、杏奈……。", "zh": "原来你在这里啊，杏奈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "80d6a45cbd0dc1ae71515e37c178c5687bbdf6a4489f92e302567b33ac0715dd", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。\n着替え……終わったんだ、ね……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n换衣服……已经换好了，是吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "b18503e367e6ce660a118a142ebdc3e9ae0947a03e74dbd981c3d90ef94c92b8", "ja": "えっと……今日は、杏奈の……相手役……\nよろしく、お願いします……♪", "zh": "那个……今天要来给杏奈……演对手戏……\n请多关照……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1004_p", "source_sha256": "545cea0b40fc6fcd4245f039fa3f45e117387c431fa2512971d9657acf54cb6c", "ja": "ああ、こちらこそ。しかし、衣装のサイズが同じだから\nって、まさか代役で参加することになるとはな……。", "zh": "啊，我才要请你多关照。不过，没想到竟然会因为服装尺寸一样，就让我来替演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "072373a6afb338cd383a85d651ef98bb53af9c1a924e5197c659b67fea70ed09", "ja": "ふふ……♪　杏奈は……{$P$}さんと\n一緒、だから……ホッとした……よ。", "zh": "呵呵……♪ 杏奈和{$P$}先生在一起，所以……就放心了……哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f681ad93dd6a052f2673f89547de195f8fcdc2abdd2261c043c59ab84ab6a377", "ja": "そ、そうか。杏奈が安心したならよかった。今日は\n杏奈の理想の式ってことだけど……見てみてどうだ？", "zh": "这、这样啊。杏奈能安心下来就好。今天是杏奈理想中的婚礼……亲眼看看之后，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "705bc040c909299271ef3410cc84782184e0200b13c34c33f00e87f6fab7c02e", "ja": "バッチリ、です……♪　お城みたいな、ケーキとか……\nケーキのナイフも……ゲームの剣、みたいで……。", "zh": "非常棒……♪像城堡一样的蛋糕……蛋糕刀也像游戏里的剑……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "ca6a31e7c608f829047e81b9dc8cd680244918da15276a8243b909de2ed82e5a", "ja": "杏奈の、大好きが……いろんなとこに、あって……\nワクワクが、いっぱい……。", "zh": "到处都有杏奈最喜欢的东西……  \n让人好期待，好兴奋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "cb9a81ea5fba44ce5d13f36f68eff2a3a32e94e2cb58c0951448426a7e59a7d8", "ja": "それに……{$P$}さんも……\nそばに、いてくれるから……。杏奈……幸せ、です♪", "zh": "而且……{$P$}先生也一直陪在我身边……杏奈……很幸福♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1010_p", "source_sha256": "765a697e79ca64ebe6c727a86a4c5c1a7c9e3b1be0dfbec3ebd49e7c7801fa5f", "ja": "そうか。そんな風に言ってもらえて光栄だよ。\nあー……時間があるし、ちょっと練習でもしないか？", "zh": "这样啊。能听到你这么说，我很荣幸。\n啊——反正还有时间，要不要稍微练习一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "d846d74c96d114253dcefd389f971d2ceab6a035eefc4a4ecb0dac010a3c6afd", "ja": "……？　あ、あの、{$P$}さん……。\n杏奈と、一緒……うれしく……ない？", "zh": "……？　那、那个，{$P$}先生……\n和杏奈一起……不高兴……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "508702724f4cec8b641f10d69af09521cb8b7100fea3bc4273d8090cbfaa03fd", "ja": "{$P$}さん……いつもと、違う……。\nちょっと、ソワソワしてる……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……和往常不一样……。\n有点坐立不安……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "5e2cc3fb4fe6f08ebf4de4e491efc4e2602263a976bb89af94777d7247591d64", "ja": "杏奈……{$P$}さんの、力に……\nなりたいのに……。うう……。", "zh": "杏奈……明明想成为{$P$}先生的力量……\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0308837167436adb12855eb6f6de3e7aaf865ccff80a1f81a4f09c8c0509e4e0", "ja": "ち、違うんだ、杏奈。\n慣れない仕事だから、ちょっと緊張してて……。", "zh": "不、不是那样，杏奈。因为是不熟悉的工作，所以有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ac657a2c50c578bc15f0724679ac8c90915e71e0ee7f9883bdfc74b0be3983bb", "ja": "でも杏奈のおかげで、緊張が解れてきたよ。", "zh": "不过，多亏了杏奈，我已经渐渐放松下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "8b083aad16c3621559edf65174e6a9d664b86c5e5fd2fd63397755bd06fca43e", "ja": "ホント……？\nえへへ……よかった……♪", "zh": "真的……？\n嘿嘿……太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a70569ca64d14226b1f57b7445554615cec4d4d1e45cd3518e54b78d5b885bf0", "ja": "ああ。心配してくれて、ありがとう。今日は杏奈の\n大好きが詰まった結婚式だからな。思いきり楽しもう！", "zh": "嗯。谢谢你为我担心。今天可是充满了杏奈最喜欢的东西的婚礼。让我们尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "38495fabfcf082c83578d0369533dff9717b63f3576ec42fc5d938c55e0cc625", "ja": "うん……！　杏奈、ケーキ切るの……楽しみ、\nだったんだ……♪　大きな剣……カッコいい……♪", "zh": "嗯……！　杏奈……之前就一直很期待……\n切蛋糕呢……♪　大大的剑……好帅气……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "e10887dc2e53c7110cc111cce31781432e927933f67edc67d613b250ed8b5b90", "ja": "ふたりの、協力技も……。杏奈に、任せて……。\nタイミングなら……杏奈が、合わせ……ます！", "zh": "两个人的合作招式……也交给杏奈吧……\n说到时机……杏奈会配合……的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1021_p", "source_sha256": "246c1feba11e30b458ff3053b39457117b2bf62899744372706aa3ad3225295b", "ja": "ははっ、なんかゲームみたいだな。\nでも、その方が杏奈らしいかもな！", "zh": "哈哈，感觉就像游戏一样。\n不过，这样或许更符合杏奈的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "574f5c134a6bb70aa0afa97db723dba8a582350330c2a79a26d4123f2cbe2d70", "ja": "えへへ……♪　ゲームだと思って……\n楽しんでね、{$P$}さん……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪ 就当成是在玩游戏……好好享受吧，{$P$}先生……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0384_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f8ecfc71761ba9eff4bc93e3a9775a69ceb2d718a7711e88f46cb4d7fbbb557c", "ja": "（その後、撮影が終わるまで杏奈は笑顔だった。\n杏奈のおかげで、失敗もなく終わってよかったな……）", "zh": "（之后，直到拍摄结束，杏奈一直都保持着笑容。多亏了杏奈，能顺利结束、没有出任何差错，真是太好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
